request.description:
DELETE /v2/notifications/{{notificationId}}/delete

Calls `NotificationService::remove`. Only the owning user can delete.

Success shape:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "notification": {},
    "message": "Notification deleted successfully"
  }
}
```

GET /v2/platform-configs

Success shape:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "platform_configs": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "setting_key": "SERVICE_CHARGE",
        "setting_value": "100",
        "created_at": "2026-08-09 12:00:00",
        "updated_at": "2026-08-09 12:00:00"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

GET /v2/snappy-orders/{{orderId}}

Calls `SnappyOrderController::getById` → `SnappyOrderService::getById`.

Access:
- Admin: any order
- Customer: own orders (`user_id`)
- Agent: assigned orders (`agent_id`)

Success shape:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "order": {},
    "message": "Order fetched successfully"
  }
}
```

Admin only. Clears `batch_id` on the order.

POST /v2/snappy-orders/{{orderId}}/unassign-from-batch

Fails if the order is not assigned to a batch.

Success shape:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "order": {},
    "message": "Order unassigned from batch successfully"
  }
}
```

GET /v2/proxy-order-change-logs/migrate

x-token only (`GlobalApiMiddleware`).

Calls `ProxyOrderChangeLogController::migrate`.

Success shape:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "message": "Migration completed successfully",
    "result": {}
  }
}
```

GET /v2/categories

Active categories only (`fetchForFrontend`).

Success shape:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "categories": [],
    "count": 0,
    "message": "Categories fetched successfully"
  }
}
```

GET /v2/categories/{{categoryId}}

Calls `CategoryService::findById`.

Success shape:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "category": {},
    "message": "Category fetched successfully"
  }
}
```

GET /v2/categories/slug/{{categorySlug}}

Calls `CategoryService::findBySlug`.

Success shape:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "category": {},
    "message": "Category fetched successfully"
  }
}
```

GET /v2/products

Active products only (`fetchForFrontend`).

Success shape:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "products": [],
    "count": 0,
    "message": "Products fetched successfully"
  }
}
```
